        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Clarence Brown, Peter Glenville, Sidney Franklin\n- Works: The Yearling\n- Organizations: Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer\n- Topics: film direction, acting, stage, family film drama\n\nFacts:\n- Clarence Brown was born on May 10, 1890, and he was an American film director.\n- Peter Glenville was born as Peter Patrick Brabazon Browne on October 28, 1913, and he was an English film and stage actor and director.\n- The Yearling is a 1946 Technicolor family film drama directed by Clarence Brown, produced by Sidney Franklin, and released by Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer.\n- The Yearling is about a young boy who adopts a trouble-making young deer.\n- Peter Glenville died on June 3, 1996.\n- Clarence Brown died on August 17, 1987.",
